{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvGT9U2MRLvqy6jqG9C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Avi-le... no, it's my son on the phone. So:\n\n\"Look, I understood when I could take the money, but not how much. It says 'אחרי 6 שנים מההפקדה הראשונה אפשר למשוך... בלי מס', and then 'למי שהגיע לגיל הפרישה מספיקות 3 שנים'. I'm 67, so for me it should be three years. I'm fairly sure about that part. How much? I don't know. The page has a little calculator with someone else's example: 300 ₪ a month from the worker and 900 ₪ from the employer. It says '+54,000', but then '−13,974' in pink and red, and something about 50,719 and tax of 29,768, and I lost it. It also says the example uses a 'מסלול מדד' with 'S&P500'. That's shares and English letters, so that's not my money. I'll ask you, or the woman at the new job, what my own numbers would be.\"\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n1. **First screen:** The heading \"קרן השתלמות\", then \"חיסכון דרך מקום העבודה... אפשר למשוך בלי מס\". That was clear. I also read the paragraph about 6 years, and 3 years for people of retirement age.\n2. **Second screen:** I saw the limits \"15,712 ₪\" and \"20,566 ₪\". I read that you can take money out before 6 years, but then you pay tax. There were buttons with \"S&P 500\" and \"אג\"ח ממשלתית צמודה\". I skipped them, except that I know government אג\"ח is safe.\n3. **Third screen, the calculator:** It showed boxes with 2.5% for me, 7.5% for the employer, \"דמי ניהול 0.54\" and \"תשואה 7\". I didn't change anything. There was a coloured bar chart that I didn't try to read. Then the \"+54,000\" and the red \"−13,974\", and that's where I got worried.\n4. **Fourth screen:** I tried to read the sentence \"משיכה אחרי 5 שנים: לחשבון נכנסים קודם 50,719 ₪ והקרן מעבירה 29,768 ₪ למס הכנסה...\". I didn't understand why so much goes to tax. The rest was in pale grey text about \"מדד\", \"S&P500\" and \"רשות שוק ההון\", and I skimmed it.\n5. **Fifth and sixth screens:** I glanced at the \"שווה לדעת\" and \"מי מציע\" sections. They name companies, הראל and אלטשולר שחם. Then \"משיכה ומעבר\" says the money arrives \"עד 4 ימי עסקים\". That's where I stopped, because I was tired. I didn't go on to the screens after the sixth.\n\n**What I didn't understand:** \"מסלול השקעה\", \"S&P 500\", \"מדד\" meaning shares, \"צמודה / לא צמודה\", \"מזומן שקלי\", \"KH-19\", \"PF-18\", \"חוקים וכללים · 10\", the dotted and dashed underlines, and why the chart has striped pink parts.\n\n**What I couldn't read or what bothered me:** The whole page is black with grey letters, and the grey parts are hard to read even with my glasses. The calculator is someone else's example and not my salary, so the first big number I'll remember, 54,000, isn't mine at all. And the red minus scared me."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3699,"cache_read_input_tokens":11472,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3699},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c92dcad1-0573-46d1-ae16-d00d98c0e98e","uuid":"70476038-9c62-4959-8302-d62f43a93ad5","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:54:12.500Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvGSw4osKQ4NqE8XnTM"}
